        "section": "Docs MCP server > Project documentation",
        "snippet": "For a repository question, call `get_docs_context` first. The call never reconciles the index itself. When committed project docs are stale or not yet indexed and the whole Git worktree is clean, the response returns a no-confirmation `prepare_docs(action=\"sync_project_docs\")` instruction bound to a preflight `plan_digest`. `prepare_docs` rechecks the clean worktree and accepted `HEAD` before mutation. Dirty or indeterminate Git state, placeholders, unsupported docs, config shadowing, and orphan pruning remain confirmation-gated.",
